{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“瓜生君，今天樱乃不来吗？”", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 418, "voice": "ar0484", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这我也不清楚，因为她也不是事前会报备的那种女孩。”", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那传邮件给她吧……问她今天要不要来这里吃午饭。”", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 418, "voice": "ar0485", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学今天也是到了午休时间，就自己走到我的座位附近。", "text_idx": 413, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“濑名同学，你从昨天起就跟瓜生君他们一起吃饭呢～”", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "结女学生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 428, "voice": "ja0028", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──这个变化，也已经在班上的同学心中留下了印象。", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这是怎样的心境转变呢？”", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "结女学生B", "alt_speaker_idx": 429, "voice": "jb0017", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不过总而言之，气氛好像变轻松了。老实说之前有点怕濑名同学……”", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "结女学生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 428, "voice": "ja0029", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "盯……", "text_idx": 420, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 418, "voice": "ar0486", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊、我、我什么都没说啦呵呵呵呵！”", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "结女学生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 428, "voice": "ja0030", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学原本是最强硬反对合并的人。", "text_idx": 415, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "结女学生们即使后来渐渐接受，她们还是会在意濑名同学的想法。", "text_idx": 430, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在各种意义上，她都是结女学生们的代表。以我的感觉来说，就是“窗”。", "text_idx": 400, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以其中的难处一直持续到了上周……", "text_idx": 408, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“都已经这样了，只能去习惯吧。而且态度再暧昧下去反而别扭……”", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 418, "voice": "ar0487", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不管实情为何，她展现出的态度转变让教室内的气氛轻松了不少。", "text_idx": 392, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哎呀，爱理也终于学会对人温柔了呢。”", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "sn0062", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "乾同学安慰了被濑名同学瞪的其他同学。", "text_idx": 395, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后和经常来我们教室的天羽学姐撒娇。", "text_idx": 416, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“怎么这样啊纱凪，把我说得像是冷酷的人一样。”", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 418, "voice": "ar0488", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哎呀～到上周为止的爱理就像北风一样喔！但是这下总算追上我了的感觉？”", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "sn0063", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喔喔，小纱同学是俯视人的态度！”", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 403, "voice": "ag0261", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呵呵呵，那小纱凪就是太阳啰？”", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 431, "voice": "mu0159", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“噜？噜～”", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 417, "voice": "pn0055", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不过小乾好相处、濑名同学比较凶的感觉也是真的～”", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 436, "voice": "ht0154", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "（盯。）", "text_idx": 437, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 418, "voice": "ar0489", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“现在就是北风在吹了。”", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哼，随便你们说。”", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 418, "voice": "ar0490", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学冷淡地把脸转向旁边。", "text_idx": 414, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "另一边，乾同学越来越得意地挺起胸。", "text_idx": 398, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“所以？你还想说什么吗，纱凪？”", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 418, "voice": "ar0491", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“对人温柔……对男生也温柔……我觉得果然要这样才对。爱理也终于了解到了呢。”", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "sn0064", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喔喔喔！原来如此！关于这一点想麻烦你说得再详细一点呢～”", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 403, "voice": "ag0262", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“对吧对吧？就是这样～”", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "sn0065", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为安洁的附和，乾同学气势正盛。", "text_idx": 399, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“爱理最近跟美羽学姐也很要好，果然这也可以说是美羽学姐的功劳对吧！”", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "sn0066", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我做了什么吗？”", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 431, "voice": "mu0160", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "突然被点到名，天羽学姐睁大了眼睛。", "text_idx": 423, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哎～呀～在说什么呢～爱理此时的改邪归正绝对是被漂浮在美羽学姐周围的温柔分子的影响喔～♪”", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 45, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "sn0067", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 418, "voice": "ar0492", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然濑名同学冷静地听着她说……", "text_idx": 434, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "毕竟乾同学一开始对我们男生就很友善，而且她最喜欢天羽学姐了。", "text_idx": 410, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她会说是因为天羽学姐的影响变成温柔的性格……这也不是不能理解。", "text_idx": 401, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“连熊喵也是最喜欢学姐了对吧？”", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“噜♪噜♪”", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 417, "voice": "pn0056", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我戳了戳趴在天羽学姐头上的熊喵。", "text_idx": 406, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呜噜～～♪”", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 417, "voice": "pn0057", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呵呵，小熊喵也最喜欢瓜生君了呢。”", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 431, "voice": "mu0161", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看到熊喵开心的样子，天羽学姐温柔地笑了。", "text_idx": 421, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "盯……", "text_idx": 420, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 431, "voice": "mu0162", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，那个……？”", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯！呐小纱凪，我觉得是多亏了瓜生君的人望喔？”", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 431, "voice": "mu0163", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸？”", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "sn0068", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为这么短的时间里就跟小熊喵要好了嘛。我认为小爱理一定也觉得瓜生君是个优秀的男孩子吧。”", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 45, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 431, "voice": "mu0164", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "汎用２", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呃，我没有……”“……”", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "爱理／纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 419, "voice": "go036", "char_id": "汎用２"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "被夸到这种程度，我不知道该摆出怎样的表情……", "text_idx": 435, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“兴奋兴奋！”", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 403, "voice": "ag0263", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“对了，你要不要再考虑一下加入喵喵社呢，瓜生君？”", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 431, "voice": "mu0165", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸？呃……”", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“如果瓜生君愿意加入的话就好了，我真的是这么想的喔。”", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 431, "voice": "mu0166", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然很高兴她这么说，但这不是简单就能回答的事……", "text_idx": 433, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“总之，现在还是只能说不好意思──”", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──嗯？", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“乾同学？”", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……瓜生。”", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "sn0072", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“！？”", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "突、突然就直呼我的名字了……", "text_idx": 422, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喂混帐瓜生！不准你再接近美羽学姐了～～～～！”", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "sn0073", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸欸欸欸！？”", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊～！啊～！果然男生就是这样、就是这样！对你们温柔是我错了！！”", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "sn0074", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不准碰我的美羽学姐你这只渣虫！啊啊当然也不准碰我！”", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "sn0075", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“被男生这种变态生物碰到会怀孕的啊──────！！！”", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "sn0076", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我被劈头骂了一顿后愣在原地。", "text_idx": 407, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……那个友善的乾同学在我眼前瞬间人格大变，大吼大叫着暴露出心中对男生的厌恶……", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊～纱凪的面具终于脱落了……”", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "结女学生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 428, "voice": "ja0031", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“应该说真亏她能撑到今天呢……明明就那么讨厌男生的说……”", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 418, "voice": "ar0494", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸、是这样吗！？”", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“虽然不知道原因，不过她好像从合并试办开始就一直戴着假面具喔……”", "text_idx": 375, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 418, "voice": "ar0495", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但果然还是脱落了……早晚要发生的事总算发生了的感觉吧。”", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "结女学生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 428, "voice": "ja0032", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为知道原本的她，所以说实话我们都觉得挺诡异的呢。”", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 403, "voice": "ag0265", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "好像就是这么一回事。", "text_idx": 402, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为濑名同学变成这样……是吗新吾？”", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 436, "voice": "ht0155", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "没错。变得能跟濑名同学正常对话后才过了没多久……", "text_idx": 412, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呵呵，小纱凪真有精神呢～”", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 431, "voice": "mu0167", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你给我记住混帐瓜生～～～～～～～！！”", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "sn0078", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就像取代濑名同学一样，这次是乾同学对我展现出了强烈的敌意。", "text_idx": 404, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──合并试办真是每一天都高潮迭起啊。", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过。", "text_idx": 393, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“美羽学姐、美羽学姐♪”", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "sn0079", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“什么事，小纱凪？”", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 431, "voice": "mu0168", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“噜、噜、呜噜～♪”", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 417, "voice": "pn0058", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好好好，乖乖。”", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，谢谢你陪小熊喵玩喔，瓜生君。”", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 431, "voice": "mu0169", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不会不会。”", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你怎么会在这里啊快点消失，去去去！不要打扰我跟学姐的亲亲热热时光啦，电灯泡！”", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "sn0080", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "关键的天羽学姐对我的态度没有丝毫改变，乾同学又想待在学姐身边……", "text_idx": 397, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "先不说立场，反正我们各自的定位都没有改变，那就这样吧。", "text_idx": 396, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你、你在看什么？该不会是迷上我了？男生一看到可爱的女孩就会这样，真是讨厌讨厌。”", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 41, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "sn0081", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呃，我没有那个意思。”", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你是说我不可爱吗！”", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "sn0082", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊哈哈，我也不是那个意思啦。”", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“到底是怎样啦，笨蛋！给我说清楚！”", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "sn0083", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“美羽学姐，瓜生这个混帐尽说些暧昧的话欺负我～”", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "sn0084", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呵呵呵，你们两个都好有趣喔。”", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 431, "voice": "mu0170", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且比起以前对话气氛反倒更热闹了。", "text_idx": 432, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这也是好事吧。”", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "乾同学也不再勉强自己，用她最自然的一面跟我相处。", "text_idx": 394, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是说你到底要在这里待到什么时候！真的快点给我消失啦，从这个世界上！”", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "sn0085", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“只要有我在，绝对不会让像你这样的混帐家伙接近学姐！”", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "sn0086", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……呃，果然我的前途还是感觉多灾多难。", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
